change.description:
Introduces the SOURCE-retention annotations
@ActionRegistration, @ActionReference,
@ViewRegistration, @StatusRegistration,
@PropertyEditorRegistration, @OptionsRegistration,
@OptionsSubRegistration, @OptionsContainerRegistration,
@ProjectTypeRegistration and @WizardRegistration, the
LayerPaths layer-path constants, the ViewLocation and
StatusAlignment enums, and the corresponding layer-generating
processors that write under the NbFx/ folder. The API is under
development until the MVP freeze.
